{"version":1,"content":"<p>香港人生活節奏急促，每日在繁忙的工作與日程之間穿梭，連安靜坐下來吃頓飯有時也變成一種奢侈。</p><p>但趕時間並不代表要在飲食質素上妥協，隨手可得的輕食也可以很美味。</p><p>近日有人氣烘焙店推出多款新品，再加上分量十足的飯糰，配咖啡或茶，最好不過。</p><p>&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T06:23:43.196076+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T06:00:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T06:17:11.511888+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T06:17:11.511888+00:00","content_hash":"e3cd9bb8a20817ac8e9b714cb5ce00901418a97873c92098b652e0a4d2bae451","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}